-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Required level for the Cataclysm high-end catalogue -- 4477 items
-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- 05_cata_highend_import.sql writes RequiredLevel straight from Item-sparse, which
-- means 85 on almost all of them -- Blizzard's value, and the right one for a
-- Cataclysm realm, but wrong here: a level-85 character could equip ilvl-416 gear
-- and skip everything between 85 and 130.
--
-- This realm already has an item level -> required level ladder of its own, in the
-- 300000+ / 400000+ custom gear:
--     ilvl 300 -> 80/82     ilvl 348 -> 100     ilvl 392 -> 120
--     ilvl 316 -> 88        ilvl 352 -> 103     ilvl 398 -> 125
--     ilvl 324 -> 90        ilvl 372 -> 110     ilvl 404 -> 125
--     ilvl 332 -> 92/95     ilvl 385 -> 108     ilvl 412+ -> 130  (594 items)
--
-- The values below follow that ladder rather than a flat 130, anchored on its two
-- densest and least ambiguous points -- ilvl 300 = level 80 and ilvl 412 = level
-- 130 -- and clamped to [80, 130]:
--     RequiredLevel = round(80 + (ItemLevel - 300) * 50 / 112)
--
-- It reproduces the realm's own numbers closely, including exactly at ilvl 352
-- (103, matching the existing ilvl-352 gear) and at ilvl 390 (120) and 416 (130).
-- A flat 130 was rejected because it would gate ilvl-346 Cata gear above this
-- realm's OWN ilvl-348 gear, which requires level 100.
--
-- Resulting spread:
--     ilvl 346 -> level 101   (415 items)
--     ilvl 350 -> level 102   (1 items)
--     ilvl 352 -> level 103   (247 items)
--     ilvl 353 -> level 104   (141 items)
--     ilvl 358 -> level 106   (73 items)
--     ilvl 359 -> level 106   (437 items)
--     ilvl 365 -> level 109   (370 items)
--     ilvl 371 -> level 112   (161 items)
--     ilvl 372 -> level 112   (299 items)
--     ilvl 377 -> level 114   (73 items)
--     ilvl 378 -> level 115   (394 items)
--     ilvl 379 -> level 115   (13 items)
--     ilvl 384 -> level 118   (512 items)
--     ilvl 390 -> level 120   (180 items)
--     ilvl 391 -> level 121   (273 items)
--     ilvl 397 -> level 123   (312 items)
--     ilvl 403 -> level 126   (281 items)
--     ilvl 410 -> level 129   (276 items)
--     ilvl 416 -> level 130   (19 items)
--
-- To use a flat 130 instead, replace every value below with 130 -- the grouping is
-- by required level, so it is a mechanical edit.
--
-- Apply AFTER 05 (which sets RequiredLevel to the Blizzard value this overrides).
-- Idempotent.
-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------

